167","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"An old man tried to move the mountains. His family kept working every day. 老人想做什么？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"移走大山"},{"key":"B","text":"建造宫殿"},{"key":"C","text":"寻找皇帝"},{"key":"D","text":"离开村庄"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"move the mountains。","verify":"\"移走大山\""},{"id":"cne_j167_q2","topicId":"cne_j167","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"An old man tried to move the mountains. His family kept working every day. 家人怎样？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"马上放弃"},{"key":"B","text":"每天继续干活"},{"key":"C","text":"只看不干"},{"key":"D","text":"搬走了"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"kept working every day。","verify":"\"每天继续干活\""},{"id":"cne_j167_q3","topicId":"cne_j167","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"A god thought the man was weak, but he sent two gods to help. 谁来帮忙？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"皇帝"},{"key":"B","text":"邻居"},{"key":"C","text":"两位神"},{"key":"D","text":"没有人"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"two gods to help。","verify":"\"两位神\""},{"id":"cne_j167_q4","topicId":"cne_j167","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"A god thought the man was weak, but he sent two gods to help. 哪一句和故事一致？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"The man gave up at once."},{"key":"B","text":"The family never worked."},{"key":"C","text":"The god refused to help."},{"key":"D","text":"The gods came to help the man."}],"answer":"D","explanation":"sent two gods to help。","verify":"\"The gods came to help the man.\""}]
